window.products.push({"id":203006,"name":"Premium Stainless Steel Potato Ricer Set with 3 Ricing Discs (Fine, Medium, Coarse) - Manual Masher, Baby Food Strainer, and Food Press with Ergonomic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ufsTzByCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Latauar is trying to create superior cooking tools and provide excellent products, services to people who are looking for a quality life. We advocate a healthy and elegant lifestyle, express our concern and love for customers with empathetic and meticulous attention. If you like cooking healthy food, at the same time, want to spend more time with your family, you may hope to find ways to speed up your food preparation time. Whether you are cooking for a customer as a professional chef or at home for a child, we all know that you don't want to be trapped in the kitchen for hours, and finally, you can only eat waxy or gluey mashed potatoes that aren't so appealing. Latauar Potato Ricer is the best solution for you. Here are the reasons for you to choose us: ▪Besides giving you smooth and fluffy mashed potatoes, this versatile tool can also be used to make gnocchi, lefse, passatelli, and spaghetti, ice cream, while it is great for straining greens, pureeing baby food and some soft-boiled vegetables like pumpkin, carrot, and cauliflower.▪The potato ricer is made of durable high-quality stainless steel, ensuring not to age with frequent use. It can maintain its quality year after year.▪Easy& safe experence: Instead of trying to whip, smash, chop and blend your potatoes to get that creamy mash, simply squeeze the potato into a savory side. Fluffy, silky, heavenly spuds right at your fingertips. The comfortably handle requires less hand strength that is a welcome relief for arthritis sufferers and those who just want to get on with their meal prep.▪It is easy to clean, and the dishwasher is safe. Packaging information: 1×Potato Ricer 3×Interchangeable Discs 1× Exquisite Packaging Box Guaranteed service: lifetime guarantee! If you are not satisfied with this product at any time, please email us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ufsTzByCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Latauar","source_asin":"B07TXFFBD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXFFBD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXFFBD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
