window.products.push({"id":203037,"name":"Remzly 30 Pack Heavy Duty S Hooks for Hanging Kitchen Utensils, Clothes, Plants, Pots and Pans - 2.4” Utility Hangers for Closet, Wire Shelving, Garag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810aDcCc5QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Purpose Storage Solution: Want to avoid clutter and keep things organized at home? Our steel metal S hooks for hanging will help in decluttering your space, no matter if it’s your kitchen, bathroom, balcony, garage, or garden. Elegant, Safe, & Convenient Design: The S hook hangers are designed to hang objects without any need of screws or installation. Moreover, they ensure damage-free hanging as the edges are smooth & safe, eliminating the risk of any harm or tearing. Sturdy, Stable, and Durable: All our hooks are made of premium alloy steel and thus are non-bendable and will last long. You can use them for hanging kitchen utensils, cups, pots, pans, coffee mugs, tools, plants, towels, clothes, jeans, coats, pants, bags, purses, hats, belts, and everything in between. Non-Slip Hooks: Tired of hooks falling off all the time? Not anymore. Our small S hooks have the perfect round curving that helps them to fit nicely on the rod or rail and hence they are slip and fall resistant. Dimensions & Weight Capacity: Each of the Remzly heavy-duty S shaped hooks is approx. 0.14 inch thick and capable of bearing up to 10 kg weight. While the small opening is 0.3 inches wide, the large opening is 0.8 inches wide. These hooks can be hung on rods, rails, and racks with up to 0.8 inch thickness. Value for the Money: Each pack of our hooks contains 30 pcs and due to their wide utility, they offer great value for your money as you have extra hooks in spare for future use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810aDcCc5QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Remzly","source_asin":"B0C65SB1YN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65SB1YN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65SB1YN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
