window.products.push({"id":203209,"name":"Fine Occasion Customized Beer Mug & Stein with Handle- Personalized Large Beer Glass Freezer Safe with Hand Crafted Pewter Monogram Initial Letter T(2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l-r-VY3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mark Your Loved Ones' Special Occasions With a Unique, Personalized Present Are you looking for a special gift to give to a special person - a friend, family member, spouse or colleague? Aren't you tired of the impractical, unremarkable and forgettable presents people usually resort to in these cases? Would you like to see a unique, personalized and memorable gift that everyone can appreciate and enjoy?   Well, look no further! Fine Occasions may just have exactly what you're looking for! Premium Crested Beer Mug - Every Beer Enthusiast's Ideal Gift! Make sure you go the extra mile and show your appreciation by gifting your friends and family with personalized beer glass mugs bearing their monogram wreathed with a floral design - they'll surely love them!   These mugs are great for any occasion - birthdays, name days, weddings, graduations, father's day, or any other significant occasion! Purchase several for your bachelor or bachelorette parties to impress your guests.   A Practical Gift of Amazing Quality Fine Occasion's large 25 Oz beer pint mugs are made of thick, durable, lead free glass and are adorned with great looking, hand polished pure pewter crests. Each one of our hearty mugs is a unique work of art - the perfect way for any beer lover to enjoy his favorite brew. Just remember to wash them by hand - you wouldn't want your precious mug to be ruined by a dishwasher!   Order these amazing customized beer mugs for yourself, your friends or your family with confidence: if they turn out to have even the slightest flaw, you can benefit from our 60-day money back guarantee! So Don't Waste Any Time - Order Your Own Unique Crested Beer Mug Today! Just Click 'Add To Cart'!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l-r-VY3vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Occasion","source_asin":"B01ECLNP0O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ECLNP0O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ECLNP0O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
