window.products.push({"id":203218,"name":"Personalized Guy Dentist Ornament 2022 – Polyresin Healthcare Hero Ornament – Unique Dentist Gifts for Men, Dental Student Gifts – Medical Profession ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-7mAqlj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Healthcare Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our dental ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a guy dentist. This Christmas, express your thanks to all the dentists for their hard work and dedication to their medical profession with this special dental decor! Expert Artist Personalization – Unlike other personalized dentist ornaments for Christmas trees that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every dentist tree ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND doctor ornament 2022 you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your vocation. These dentist Christmas ornaments honor the important work that you and your loved ones do every day. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your dental decoration will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your home. The perfect dental hygienist gifts for women, dental assistant ornament gifts and appreciation gifts for all the dentists in your life! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our dental hygienist ornaments make beautiful dental school gifts, dental gifts for men, dentist boss gifts and dental office decor to cherish every holiday season. Your dentist Christmas ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! free custom personalization included with your dental ornaments. The ultimate present for family, friends, and those who make a difference every day! Happy Dentists – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful nurse, pharmacist, dentist, paramedic and doctor ornaments for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 Christmas tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your dentist decoration, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-7mAqlj1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08TMTKGJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMTKGJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMTKGJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
