window.products.push({"id":203366,"name":"Hosley's Set of 2 Limoncello Scented Wax Cubes / Melts - 2.5 oz each. Hand Poured Wax Infused with Essential Oils. Ideal GIFT for Weddings, Spa, Reiki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sk4cPKuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hosley's Set of 2 Limoncello Scented Wax Cubes / Melts. 2.5 oz each. For use with wax tart/melt warmers. Hand poured wax infused with essential oils. Create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere in your home with Hosley's wax cubes/melts. As soon as they start melting, they instantly release a pleasant, soothing fragrance! As the fragrance is dispersed throughout your home it will freshen the air and help assist in removing lingering odors, without the use of an open flame. Once hardened, these wax cubes are recyclable and reusable. They don't produce any wick or soot making an easy clean-up with just a paper towel. They are easy to use, just break off a cube and add to your wax warmer and enjoy! Use one cube at a time to fill your space with fragrance (use more than one as needed depending on the size of the space). Our wax melts spread a relaxing fragrance and a welcoming atmosphere throughout your home. Not only are these wax cubes safe to use in your home or office, but they also provide a great benefit with a no-flame feature (Wax Warmer Sold Separately). Hosley wax melts are a perfect source for everyday use. Wrap them up as a gift or use them as a stocking stuffer. Spread these fragrances around and share with your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Sk4cPKuxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosley","source_asin":"B01K8WB9AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K8WB9AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K8WB9AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":203367,"name":"Melitta MES1W OneOne Single Serve Coffeemaker, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TRQ8FT06L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cool and contemporary, the new Melitta One:One Java Pod Coffeemaker in white is what coffee lovers have been wishing for. In less than one minute, the One:One brews a single perfect portion of coffee directly into your waiting cup. This streamlined machine requires no filters or ground coffee, so there's no measuring and no mess. One:One uses a revolutionary Java Pod system to deliver 3 mug-sized servings of hot coffee for each brewing cycle. Simply drop in a pre-portioned Java Pod filled with aromatic coffee, and push a button to select a 5-oz. European-style or a smoother 8-oz. American-style cup. Includes 1 each of 6 Java Pods: Buzzworthy, French Kisses, Go Hazelnuts, Skip the Buzz, Love at First Sip and Café Kind of Day. Additional Java Pods sold separately. Imported. From the Manufacturer Skip those expensive coffee bars. This one:one coffee maker gives you more time to do the things you love. Leave your slippers on. Read the whole paper instead of just the headlines. Catch your favorite morning show. All the while sipping an exquisite coffee beverage, handmade by you, in less than one minute. Simplicity, speed, and a perfect cup of coffee every time. You should never have to think before that first cup of coffee. That's why we created the one:one coffee maker. Forget the filters. Forget the measuring and the mess. Just drop our specially made java-pod into the machine, and you'll have a perfect mug of rich, aromatic coffee in less than a minute. Simple as that. The one:one coffee maker brews directly into your mug, one customized cup at a time. Your coffee is always fresh, never scorched. It's the ultimate cup of coffee every time. And its definitely not your dad's coffee maker. Features: Freedom to choose different blends or flavors for each cup you brew Freedom to choose different blends or flavors for each cup you brew Large water tank makes three mug-size servings before refilling is needed Large water tank makes three mug-size servings before refilling is needed Choice of a 5-oz. bold European style coffee or an 8-oz. American style at the touch of a button Choice of a 5-oz. bold European style coffee or an 8-oz. American style at the touch of a button","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TRQ8FT06L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melitta","source_asin":"B00009KF1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009KF1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009KF1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":203368,"name":"Braun BNC002BKBK Classic Analog Quartz Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1rbuJi8BmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Hit the road with a classic analog value for reliable time reference and easy alarm functions / Large, eas-find alarm switch From the Manufacturer In 1971, Braun launched a series of travel alarm clocks and watches. The infamous German industrial designers, Dieter Rams and Dietrich Lubs were the masterminds behind the project; and, with their \"Less, is more\" design philosophy they produced a number of memorable products for Braun including some of the best travel alarm clocks around. Over the last 40 years, Braun time pieces were characterized by their pure, highly functional and timeless design with no superfluous details: Every feature directly reflects a function. Rooted in over half a century of modern design at Braun, the core values of functionality, quality and aesthetics are reflected in all clocks and watches. The strength of clarity and simplicity of their design makes them a pleasure to use and to own. The analogue clocks were manufactured with the intention to prioritize innovation and durability. The beautifully sleek structure and dial illumination, together with the slight graying back of the numbers ensures that the hour arms are clear and easily readable. All the clocks use precision German movements, known for their silent nature and high accuracy. A variety of models use radio controlled movements for complete accuracy of time. A selection of the very best classic clocks and watches have been recreated in keeping with the high standards of quality of the originals. At the same time, brand new designs on both watches and clocks take the collection further than ever before","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1rbuJi8BmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Braun","source_asin":"B00006WNLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006WNLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006WNLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
