window.products.push({"id":203462,"name":"Yunjetek Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 26Kpa Powerful Cordless Stick Vacuum with 300W Motor, 6-in-1 Lightweight Battery Vacuum Up to 45mins Runtime, Self-S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lb6LOVYjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yunjetek Provide 12 Months Warranty and 7*24 After-sales Service for the Best Purchasing Experience for Our Valued Customers! 【Brushless Motor & Powerful Suction】- The Yunjetek Cordless vacuum is equipped with 300W brushless motor which provide Max 26Kpa Strong Suction Power, 3 Suction modes can meet your all daily cleaning needs, 9Kpa deal with hair and low pile carpet,15Kpa deal with biscuits, food residue, and 26Kpa can deal with large particles. Newest Brushless motor has ultra-longer service life, higher efficiency, less heat and noise , which will give you better use performance for Whole-home Deep Cleaning. 【45Mins Max Lasting Runtime】- Powered by a lithium-ion battery, it runs up to 15-45mins uninterrupted Whole-home Deep Cleaning from just one quick 4 – 5 hours charge (Max mode: 15mins, Middle mode: 30mins , Standard mode: 45mins), giving you freedom to move from one room to the next or up and down stairs. in addition, the battery can be removed from the machine and charged on its own. (Spare batteries are available to order separately to increase runtime) 【Multi-Cone Cyclone Filtration】- The filtering has fully sealed filter system with a high-density HEPA filter, a stainless steel filter and a cyclone separator. Multi-cone cyclones captures dust and particles to 0.1 microns, makes the exhaust air cleaner, can effectively prevent secondary pollution. Detachable HEPA filter is easy to clean under the tap, no hassle of suction power weakening or dust clogging 【Flexible Motorized Brush with LED Light】- 2 in 1 Triple Turbine Motorized Brush is swivel 180 degrees, enable you to glides across all floors (Such as: carpets, hard floors& Tiles), no need to change floorhead; The front LED lights make it easily to see the dust under furniture or in hard-to-reach conner, the Stick Vacuum makes cleaning these areas an absolute breeze, Giving you the very best cleaning performance, when you really need it. 【Low Noise Design and Light Weight】- ultra-quiet operation sound avoids annoying noise and block vibration, the volume of the vacuum cleaner is as low as about 65 decibels when it is working, friendly to your baby and pet. machine weights only 3.2lb easily converts to a handheld, the extendable tube and multiple attachments also make it easy to vacuum curtains, ceilings and high surfaces, meeting you floor-to-ceiling cleaning needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lb6LOVYjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yunjetek","source_asin":"B0BZTPW4TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZTPW4TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZTPW4TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
