window.products.push({"id":203655,"name":"Coffee Tumbler, 16 oz Iced Coffee Cup with Lid and Straw, Clear and Reusable Travel Coffee Mug for Women Girls, Spill Proof and Portable, BPA Free Tri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBJJhvzQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE ELEGANT DESIGN: One lid for two ways to drink: silicone straw drinking spout is best for cold drinks, with hygienic fast flowing nozzle, drinks flow easily and quickly. Convenient wide mouth makes cleaning and adding ice cubes easy. It will not hot to hold with silicone sleeve. One-handed size makes it easier to pick up and go. It's a must have coffee tumbler for your on-the-go lifestyle and the perfect gift for your loved ones PREMIUM MATERIAL BPA FREE: This coffee tumbler is 100% BPA, BPS and phthalates free. We use only safe materials. The straw mouthpiece is made of food-grade silicone, which is soft and chewy, oral-friendly and bite proof. The straw and lid are hard PP plastic. The bottle built with sturdy premium eco-friendly Tritan LEAKPROOF DESIGN: Spill proof coffee travel mug with screw-in cup lid is equipped with a airtight silicone sealing ring, which provides a good leak-proof. Flip lid opens and locks easily, You can open the flip lid with thumb in one second TRAVEL COFFEE MUG WITH LID & STRAW: The lid is an important detail if you plan to take the mug outside of your house. There are also lids that provide a spot for inserting a straw. The tabs are more prone to accidental spills, especially when the tab becomes worn. Lids with a sliding tab tend to provide a little more protection against spills LIFETIME CUSTOMER SERVICE: If you have any questions, please contact our customer service and we will help you immediately. Cups, mugs or vessels, it doesn't matter what you call them, but whatever you drink your coffee out of is a highly personal choice. Filling it with BABLOV coffee mugs from us, you're doing something right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cBJJhvzQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BABLOV","source_asin":"B09Y53HCMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y53HCMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y53HCMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":203656,"name":"Air Fryer XL, Large Family Size Airfryer Digital Touch Screen, 8-in-1 Hot Air Fryer Oven to Grill Bake Roast, Non-Stick Basket & Recipe Book, 5.8 QT S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C4ZsCZsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE ONE-TOUCH OPERATION: With 8 pre-set cooking programs and an easy-to-use LCD digital screen, this large air fryer can grill, bake, roast or fry anything: fries, pizza, chicken, steak, bacon, shrimp and even cake. You can also set your own cooking time (1-60 mins) & temperature (180-400F) to suit your favorite recipes. FASTER, MORE EVEN COOKING WITH LESS OIL: The Sincreative hot air fryer features 360° hot air circulation technology which cooks your food more evenly and reduces the use of oil & fat by up to 85% compared to deep frying methods, whilst still delivering the same delicious results! And with 1700W of power, it also means cooking time is half that of a conventional rotisserie oven. HEALTHY EATING FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY: Cleverly designed to look like a compact air fryer, it’s really a large, family size airfryer with a 5.8 qt spacious square basket that can fit a 5-6lbs whole chicken. We also give you a cookbook with delicious & healthy recipes that your family and friends will love! Why not give this beautiful air fryer as a gift for a wedding, birthday, or any other occasion? EASY TO CLEAN: The detachable, non-stick basket is dishwasher safe, whilst the stainless steel main unit of the air fryer can be simply wiped clean with a damp cloth after it has cooled down. The matt stainless steel exterior is fingerprint resistant, so it will remain smudge-free even with regular use. OUR PROMISE TO YOU: This hot air fryer has been designed and made with the greatest care, with 100% safe PFOA-free & BPA-free materials and coating. Fully ETL and UL certified. We even give you a 1-year warranty so you have total peace of mind!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C4ZsCZsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sincreative","source_asin":"B099MX2M9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203656","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099MX2M9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099MX2M9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
