window.products.push({"id":203679,"name":"Xbeauty Electric Fireplace Stove, Freestanding Fireplace Heater with Realistic Flame, Indoor Electric Stove Heater, Portable, Infrared, Thermostat, Ov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P9oj3UqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Grace beautiful Infrared heater] Elegant and unique design, classic retro style, and stable solid structure. These words do not even begin to describe this electric fireplace stove. The designer used special materials to keep the product strong and reduce the weight of the furnace to 17.6Lbs and size is only 16.3\"L X 12.2\"W X 22.8\"H ,which means the product is very portable. An adult can move it easily. Also, lighter weight means it’s safer. [Real and bright flame effect] Based on the latest technology, the flame’s effect of this product not only surpasses the real flame in terms of aesthetics, but also avoids the danger posed by the real flame. The atmosphere created by the combination of the bright flame and the log is unparalleled. You can enjoy the visual experience and warmth brought by this heater in your bedroom, study, hall with your family. [Safe and efficient power] This electric stove heater has two heating modes of 1000W and 1500W to adapt to different environments and needs. 120V voltage, 60Hz frequency, 5100BTUS, 12.5AMPS. The overheating protection system will shut down the power when the temperature reaches a critical level to ensure the safety of user. In the lower right corner of the furnace has knobs for adjusting the thermostat and brightness of the flame, which is very convenient and relaxed. [Warm and comfortable experience] This product USES the latest infrared heating technology to make heating more safer. Moreover, after testing, the maximum heating range of this heater is 400sq to 500sq, and the average heating time is 5 to 7 minutes. The vents at the bottom of the furnace effectively reduce the noise generated by the heater when it is working. The maximum noise will not exceed 40db. [Customer Serve] Free replacement for installation problems, damage and missing parts within1 year. If any problem, please feel free to contact our customer service team. We are happy to answer any questions from our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P9oj3UqnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xbeauty","source_asin":"B0BKZHHH6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZHHH6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZHHH6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
