window.products.push({"id":203812,"name":"Kescas 8 Inch Memory Foam Hybrid Twin Mattress - Knitted Fabric Cover with Linen - Heavier Coils for Durable Support - Pocket Innersprings for Motion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":164.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bvrb9agRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPPORTIVE FOAM & POCKET SPRINGS - Our firmest mattress ever is engineered with heavier gauge steel independent pocket innersprings for added stability and medium firmness. With soft comfort foam, durable high-density foam and motion-isolating independent pocket springs with a quilted jacquard cover offer a medium firm feel that’s perfect for stomach sleepers, and plus-sized individuals and those who enjoy a very medium firm mattress. CERTIPUR US CERTIFIED & PRESSURE RELIEVING - Highest quality foam is CertiPUR-US Certified for durability, performance, and content. 4 foam layers for optimal softness and support. Provide cushioning and serve as protective buffer, relieve painful pressure points on the body. Ideal for stomach sleepers and those who suffer from back and neck pains . KNITTED FABRIC COVER WITH LINEN - Incorporates a knitted fabric cover containing linen, engineered to reduce sweat, maintain the electrolyte balance of your body and prevent static. Its fireproof layer are made of non-woven fabric, which does NOT contain any glass fiber. Knitted fabric cover offers the softest touch and luxurious feel. Made of dual-layered soft knitted fabrics, super breathable! MADE IN CENTURY-OLD BRAND FACTORY FOAM AND GLOBAL MATERIAL - Innovative performance in every layer, manufactured right here. We are located in South Carolina. Customized according to North America customer standards. Straight out of our first ever, state-of-the-art, global production technology in North America. EXPERTLY PACKAGED AND GENERAL NOTE - Kescas mattress is efficiently compressed into a box that’s shipped right to your door, simply unbox, unroll and the mattress does the rest, expanding to its original shape within 72 hours. 100 hassle-free night trial, 100-Days Money Back and worry-free 10 year limited warranty included. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there is any question, we will reply to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Bvrb9agRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kescas","source_asin":"B0BM5TVTJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM5TVTJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM5TVTJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
