window.products.push({"id":203966,"name":"Kungfu Teacup,Chinese Long-Quan Celadon Teacup,Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TaLftN27L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a beautifully designed and hand-crafted vessel that is perfectly balanced for ease of handling to brew and to serve tea.Tea connoisseurs often brew the tea right in the gaiwan although it may also be used conventionally as a tea cup. Celadon with black celadon base and natural glaze crackle is called Elder, Brother Kiln . The celadon mouth appears purple and in the place where base in exposed , it appears black. This is so called “Purple mouth and black foot ”. Graceful and refined and dignified , it was one of the five famous kilns of the Song Dynasty. China is the hometown of porcelains.It’s an important creation of the working people of Han nationality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TaLftN27L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHAMS","source_asin":"B07QH7DM79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QH7DM79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QH7DM79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":203967,"name":"Supla Valentine's Day Party Decorations Set - 42 Heart Shaped Balloons Latex Balloons 1 LOVE Letters Banner Sign Red Curling Balloon Ribbon Red Satin ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B1kVxkJ1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 40 Pcs Heart Shaped Balloons Latex Balloons in red pink rosy white, 4 pcs LOVE Letters signs, 1 roll Curling Balloon Ribbon, 4.2 yards long Satin Ribbon, 1 pcs Hand Inflator Pump, 1 roll Double Sided Glue Dots. HOW TO DECORATE WITH THIS BALLOONS AND BANNER SET: 1. Bundle the heart balloons together and attach curling ribbon on it to create beautiful balloon bouquet. 2. This set of balloons and banner makes a great prop for awesome photos. 3. Add the balloons to a flower arrangement, basket or gift. 4. Tie the balloons to weights and arrange them around the room at different heights for creating a lush balloon forest look. 5. Set up an arrangement of roses, champagne and cupcakes with heart balloons on a gold platter for a romantic Valentine's centerpiece. 6. Attach curling ribbon to inflated balloons and let them float to the ceiling or scatter on floor. 7. Hang photos from the balloons to create a chandelier over a table or make balloon place cards for a valentine's dinner. 8. Tape the heart balloons and hang the LOVE banner on wall to create a sweet backdrop for your Valentine's Day party. 9. Valentine's Day decorations for school: Attach a heart balloon to the seat of every kid, tie balloons to favor bags, scatter inflated balloons around the classroom, and so on. 10. Other balloon decoration ideas: Balloon cupcake toppers, floral balloon arch, balloon wrapped in tulle, balloon garland, balloon wreath, tassels on balloons, and so on. 11. Hang the LOVE banner in the dining room, above a fireplace, mantel, on kitchen cabinets, existing shelving, a staircase, entryway wall for celebrating the season of love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B1kVxkJ1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supla","source_asin":"B07L6FLX9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-203967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L6FLX9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L6FLX9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
